                        <p>Aligned. Accountable. Invested.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-lg-3 s_sgc_split_feature_point">
                        <span class="s_sgc_split_feature_point_badge"><i class="fa fa-line-chart"/></span>
